# The first mission, the supernova, from the jump that gives it to the debriefing. It starts from supernova-mission.cdr
# (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the reference's own save at Lave with 31 jumps counted outside the first galaxy, one
# short of the mission (UpdateMissionSchedule gives it on the 32nd), a galactic hyperdrive, an escape capsule, 10,000
# credits, and its random state 52 draws on, so that the jump lands at Laribebi, whose tech level sells a galactic
# hyperdrive (a search of 200 draw counts found it). The galactic jump is the 32nd counted: the mission is given, and
# the fuel leak it arms empties the tank. The escape capsule takes the commander to Laribebi's station, where the status
# screen briefs him (ShowMissionBriefing): Y takes the refugees, which empties the hold. With no fuel for sale in the
# mission, he buys another capsule and a galactic hyperdrive and jumps on to galaxy 3, the jump the debriefing waits
# for. The capsule takes him to the station there, but a capsule is no docking, so the status screen does not debrief
# him; he launches and docks by hand, with the keys launch-and-dock.replay docks with at Lave (a launch sets every
# station up alike), and the status screen debriefs him (ShowMissionDebriefing): 1,000 credits for the full hold of
# refugees.
file JAMESON.CDR supernova-mission.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # D10, Disc access, on Load commander
key 1; wait 0.3                    # Load commander: the catalogue, JAMESON.CDR selected
key Return; wait 0.5               # loaded
